# This directory holds Playwright visual-regression baseline screenshots
# (golden images) generated by `toHaveScreenshot` in visual-regression.spec.ts.
#
# Baselines are committed to version control and compared against on every CI
# run. To (re)generate or update baselines after an intentional UI change:
#
#   npm run test:visual:gate:update --workspace=web
#   git add apps/web/e2e/visual-regression.spec.ts-snapshots
#   git commit -m "chore: update visual regression baselines"
#
# See e2e/VISUAL_REGRESSION.md for details.
